--- !yfi/header
version: 1
namespace: brute::blind
visibility: public
---
# `brute` forces the mutability gate and never the visibility one: a member
# cannot grant itself sight of what it was never shown, so this stays E0216.
Blind: !node &Blind
  brute peek: !ref ../vault/Secret
# The same in a clause position, where `brute` now reaches: still E0216, still
# nothing recorded as forced. `brute` applies only within the scope it can
# already see, so it can never be used to find out whether a private scope
# holds a name — the refusal has the same shape either way.
brute Sightless: !node &Sightless
  extends: !ref ../vault/Secret
